      "sourceErrata": [
        "6E16 SolutionBank p6 introduction prints sin u in the differential. Calculations and authored work use dx = 2 sinh u cosh u du.",
        "6C6b and 6C7 SolutionBank calls ln(u ± sqrt(u²−1)) arcosh u. The positive principal inverse is arcosh u; the equation cosh x = u has two real solutions ±arcosh u. Both exact logarithms retained.",
        "6C9a the identity uses a = ln 2. 0.693 is rounded and explicitly approximate.",
        "6D17c retained printed wording “where f is function to be determined.”"
      ],
